Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,WHY?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.67,0:00:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I DON'T UNDERSTAND!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:10.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boss truly is a fierce foe.\N{\rSubtitle-2}Why? Why?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.88,0:00:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well? What'd she screw up this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea did nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My plan was impeccable!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When Teach was walking around town,\Nwe waited until he was in front of the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.79,0:00:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By all rights, he should have been worried\Nabout Grete and taken her inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's just what men do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why are you soaking wet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:44.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He simply left like he'd seen right through us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a first-rate spy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:49.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He never lets down his guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.75,0:00:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a formidable opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:55.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.33,0:00:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.63,0:00:59.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been wondering this for a while now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but are you sure you're any good at seduction?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.92,0:01:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:22.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Me wo aketa kikkake wa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:27.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Kokoro saku joukei
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:30.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Hirari hirari yubi no sukima kara
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.29,0:01:32.92,Song,,0,0,0,,Mietekuru shinjitsu wo nirame
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.92,0:01:37.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Kizukareta no wa, rakuen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.88,0:01:41.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Massakasama ochite
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:45.58,Song,,0,0,0,,Aa tatoe kouya demo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:52.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Hitori de ikiru to oritachimashou
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:54.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Ikanakucha
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:57.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Koko ni aru hana wa ima eien nare to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.67,0:02:04.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Gokujou no chihedo wo haite watashi ga ueta mono
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:09.54,Song,,0,0,0,,Kono koe de ashi de te de watashi no mama mogaku hodo ni
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:15.63,Song,,0,0,0,,Doushiyou mo nai sekai ga itoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.00,0:02:22.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Tadoritsuku wa kanarazu
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.67,0:02:28.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Musekaeru hodo no yume
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How utterly humiliating!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:43.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How dare Monika even say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're young, you've got an erotic figure,\Nand you come across as an easy lay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.17,0:02:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've got the kind of looks that idiot dudes\Ngo crazy for, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pressing your massive tits against some ape to get him\Nhot and bothered so you can manipulate him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,hardly requires a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:01.46,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,No, no, she's just a contrarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:06.04,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Surely, the others all revere me\Nas an expert in matters of romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:08.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,But now that I think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:13.25,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,that might just be because none of them are proactive\Nabout matters of the heart themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:19.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Lamplight is so full of people who\Nshy away from romance, it's almost worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mind helpin' out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:28.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the only one we can turn to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:33.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got a love letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.75,0:03:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:37.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What kind of person is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:38.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:42.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sara was playin' with Johnny\Nat a pet shop in the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.63,0:03:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and this guy gave the letter to one of the\Nemployees to pass along to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"I fell for you at first sight."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"From, Dominic Maura."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And? How did you reply?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:56.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wrote a letter back turning him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:59.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was happy he felt that way,\Nbut my schedule's just too full.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:01.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's when these started comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow! What passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a stalker, is more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:11.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To be honest, it's gotten to be so much that\NI feel awkward even going to the pet shop anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:14.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And Mr. Johnny used to love it there so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:16.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, Sara, you haven't actually met\Nthis Dominic yet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, we've only exchanged letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why not try meeting up with him, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I'm a spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forget about that for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:35.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you want to give dating a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.21,0:04:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's actually someone who I think is lovely...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:43.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-but I'm not sure if that's actually love or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:53.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I might be enamored with\Nthe idea of being in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:57.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That it would be nice to fall for someone\Nthe way Miss Grete did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:04:59.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At your age, that's completely normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it's settled, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go out and meet Dominic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.17,0:05:07.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, it will help you figure out\Nif what you're feeling really is love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think you're super cute, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You look wonderful, Big Sis Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the outfit's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.04,0:05:22.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea picked out a real winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should certainly think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You never disappoint, Master Thea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn, good going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.88,0:05:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be your backup, Sara,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:34.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so make sure you take your radio along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're going to be watching me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.33,0:05:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With all of us working together,\Nwe'll be able to orchestrate the best date ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.13,0:05:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ugh, what a bunch of busybodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.21,0:05:49.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:52.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm only gonna stick around until midmorning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:54.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you are coming after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If he pulls any funny business,\NI'll punch him into next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.79,0:06:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm getting butterflies now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:02.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got the radios all up and working, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:04.42,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,This is good.\N{\rSubtitle-4}I hope you don't mind if I use this as reference{\r}\N{\rSubtitle-4}for planning a date with the boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:05.67,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I knew they were interested in romance.\N{\rSubtitle-4}I hope you don't mind if I use this as reference{\r}\N{\rSubtitle-4}for planning a date with the boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.67,0:06:07.67,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I knew they were interested in romance.\N{\rSubtitle-5}I'm rooting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"I'm off to watch over Lamplight's adolescences."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, they all went out together?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I follow, but it's nice that they're\Ntaking a breather every now and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.71,0:06:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a clear visual on the rendezvous site, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.71,0:06:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no danger in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:37.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So far, so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:41.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And remember, what do we do if the guy is a dirtbag\Nwho tries to get handsy with Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Blow him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:45.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Get him caught up in one of my accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:47.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That seems a little excessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sounds as though we're getting good reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:51.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn, that place is crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, it's a café you can go into with your pets, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pets are all the rage right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hear that they're super popular\Nwith the rich and famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I am a bit worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:03.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To be honest, Sara comes across as timid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and that sort of thing can attract some real weirdos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have visual on the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone came up and started talking to Big Sis Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's got beige pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:16.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A black jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A lily-of-the-valley bouquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bronze-colored hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That must be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gulp...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's a total hunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:37.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I probably made a complete nuisance of myself,\Nsending you all those letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of getting a dog myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and as I was walking around the pet shop,\NI happened to spot you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and, well, I fell for you at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-that's very kind of you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:54.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As for me, I'm a senior at Shalita University.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I study genetically modified crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you heard of Weyrich corn?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's incredibly nutritious,\Nso it's great to feed to your pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:08.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Actually, do you know of any food that\Nwould be good for a hawk's health?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mine's been a little under the weather lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.46,0:08:12.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A hawk, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:15.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll have to ask the professor next time I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.67,0:08:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean, one of the teachers at your university?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, Professor Tott.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I met him at a conference last month,\Nand we really hit it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't he one of the biggest names in biology?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:28.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is boring, I'm gonna bail.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, it feels rude to keep eavesdropping like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:36.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, we came all the way to the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should grab some sweets\Nbefore we head on back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh, sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would love to join you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:42.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited.\N{\rSubtitle}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm starvin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:45.92,Subtitle-5,,0,0,0,,Ooh, how does getting pancakes sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The date looks like it's going swimmingly.\N{\rSubtitle-4}Ooh, how does getting pancakes sound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:58.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,It seems as though they're going to\Nkeep getting closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:09:00.88,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,so I should check him, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodness, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's been so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Have you been keeping well?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-not to be rude, but who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mistook you for someone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:31.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:39.21,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,The desire I saw in that man...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:51.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You did great today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.58,0:09:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Thea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shall we walk while we chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:10:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My heart was beating a mile a minute back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:01.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, how was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think of Dominic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I haven't finished getting all my emotions in order yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I really just don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, it made me happy when he called me cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but it's also really embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,People don't tell me that all that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:22.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, Sara...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to tell-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I looked up every student currently\Nenrolled at Shalita University.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:39.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There isn't a single senior that goes there\Nnamed Dominic Maura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, there weren't any students involved\Nin developing Weyrich corn,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and Professor Tott was on an\Ninternational research trip all last month,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:51.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so he didn't go to any conferences.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:55.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:57.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dominic just told me-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:59.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,His real name is Tarik Pupke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.83,0:11:01.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He got arrested last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.96,0:11:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Truth is, he runs romance scams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.21,0:11:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's a con artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:08.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:12.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He targets younger girls without\Nmuch romantic experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once he starts a relationship with them,\Nhe pretends to be hard up for cash
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.17,0:11:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and gets them to steal jewelry\Nand stuff from their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:22.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But if he got arrested just last month,\Nthen why is he free now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.42,0:11:25.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And why would he go after someone like me\Nwithout any valuables?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla and Grete are tailing him as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.58,0:11:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He just went into a pub with some friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got it in you to listen in on their conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.79,0:11:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's hilarious how naïve this kid is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once I get her to fall for me, I'll snatch up her dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Rich people will pay through the nose\Nfor a puppy that well-trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.92,0:11:47.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After that, it won't matter what she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:50.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once again, there won't be enough\Nevidence to prosecute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Man, what a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.17,0:11:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What guy in his right mind would ever\Nfall for a bumpkin like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.83,0:12:04.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's about to experience a fate worse than death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:08.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyone who toys with Sara's feelings\Nlike that is dead meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:14.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pl-please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.04,0:12:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:24.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was being stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would have realized, if I'd thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:31.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should have figured out it was a con\Nthe moment someone said
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:33.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they'd fallen for someone like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:37.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was that stuff just now true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is Dominic really a conman?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna go for a nice little stroll, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.21,0:12:49.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don’t get in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:57.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to teach that guy that there are\Nsome people you just don't mess with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:12:59.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:02.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that I have a better way to settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Dreamspeaker,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.83,0:13:06.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's time to lure them to their ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grete, could you make an outfit\Nthat matches this drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily and Erna, help me whip up some perfume.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Will do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla, I'm sorry to have to ask this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but would you mind running out and\Ngetting us the materials we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette, your job is to compile me\Na list of Far East restaurants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Roger that, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.17,0:13:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika, continue keeping tabs on Tarik's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:30.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This isn't just Sara's problem anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:37.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our pride is on the line here,\Nso let's make this mission a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:38.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I got you all wrapped up in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:45.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anyone needs to apologize, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.25,0:13:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.96,0:13:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But if I can offer an excuse,\NI wanted to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to see what a charming girl you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:14:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and that you're just as qualified and have as much\Nright as anyone to experience romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.71,0:14:04.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted the entire team to realize\Nthat about themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:06.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Thea...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:10.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Matters of romance need to be settled with romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm done messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.25,0:14:15.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This time, I'm going to make him\Nfall in love like he's never fallen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well now, this is fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:24.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry I kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:29.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.88,0:14:31.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:33.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I get to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-so am I!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.58,0:14:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never expected you to invite me out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is my favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really? Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.46,0:15:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:13.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.33,0:15:15.58,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,My chest feels so tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:18.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, I picked up a new hobby recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:22.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My dad is really into collecting records, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:27.29,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Could this be destiny at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:29.83,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,We like all the same foods,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:32.00,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,and the records she's listing off are all so good,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:35.08,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I would kill to get my hands on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:36.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,And on top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:40.42,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,she's doing that little head tilt thing I love!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:43.00,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Now, I see how pretty her skin is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.67,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,It makes me want to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.08,0:15:46.88,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,God, she's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.92,0:15:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-here's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.63,0:15:57.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After this, would you be interested in\Nstopping back at my place for a nightcap?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.21,0:16:02.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, just one drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.08,0:16:04.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That sounds nice, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:05.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:07.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I do have one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course, anything you ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, could you tell me the truth about\Neverything you've done up until now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tarik Pupke?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.13,0:16:20.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-how do you know that name?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a conman, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:24.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not what's happening here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This... This is how I really feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:34.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess all's well that ends well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:42.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but how could you be sure that\Nfollowing your directions
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.58,0:16:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,would be enough to take down Tarik?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:47.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because I looked into his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:52.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know that man's desires like the back of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:55.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I had to do was match that up with Sara's charm,\Nand it was a done deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:17:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to tell you why\NI washed out of my academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.29,0:17:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was because I had relations with too many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.00,0:17:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Male faculty, local men, even some of\Nthe other girls at my academy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.83,0:17:11.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:14.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's this spy I admire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.71,0:17:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In order to become like her,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I trained ceaselessly to be able to charm,\Nentice, and manipulate people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I bring my full talents to bear,\Nseducing some petty con artist is child's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:33.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When it comes to matters of love,\NI'm the best in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-but meeting you has inspired me\Nto turn over a new leaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.21,0:17:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the truth, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My feelings for you are real!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, please-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but life isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:49.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give this to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:53.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is for all those girls who weren't able\Nto get fraud charges to stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:55.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You tricked me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:58.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Turnabout is fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.25,0:17:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-hold on-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you lay a finger on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.13,0:18:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tarik.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even though it was just for a moment,\Nyou fell in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I have my confidence back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:24.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there's already a man in my life far lovelier than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-um, I thought the plan was to have Miss Grete\Ncome pick me up while crossdressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea gave me a basic rundown of the situation\Nand asked me to step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:47.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, s-sorry, your arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and leave them linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:54.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretending to be lovers is in our\Ninterests at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:18:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I let myself get all worked up thinking that\NI might get to fall in love someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.21,0:19:05.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for someone your age\Nto take an interest in romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In fact, why don't we hit the town?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.79,0:19:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I apologize that you'll have to settle for me\Nplaying the part of the boyfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I'll do my best to take the lead\Nand show you a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That way, you’ll know that you don’t have
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:24.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,anything to be afraid of the next time you feel\Nready to have another go at falling in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's have a magnificent evening together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.42,0:19:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My golden days are finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tarik was arrested again on\Ncharges of suspected fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, his old victims have filed\Ncivil cases against him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's finally getting the comeuppance he deserves!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:00.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You nailed it like always, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:06.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't forget about all the work\Nmy homemade aphrodisiac put in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:09.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No one but Thea coulda pull this plan off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Were you all surprised to find out that I\Ncan make stimulants and intoxicants
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:16.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll follow you to the ends of the earth, Master.\N{\rSubtitle-4}on top of just paralytics?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.\N{\rSubtitle-4}You totally were, weren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Today, I've come up with a plan\N{\rSubtitle-4}That's right! It's your girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:20.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that will finally let us take down Teach.\N{\rSubtitle-4}The Republic's hidden genius is right here! Among you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:23.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This plan revolves around an outfit!\N{\rSubtitle-4}No matter how fierce the foe is, as soon as I get involved,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An outfit?\N{\rSubtitle-4}I rain judgement down upon them like it's nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:26.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As soon as I saw, I said to myself, this is it!\N{\rSubtitle-4}I rain judgement down upon them like it's nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.71,0:20:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we want to defeat him, this is how we're going to do it!\N{\rSubtitle-4}Go on, praise me more!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:32.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll be wearing one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.38,0:20:35.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach will go down before he knows what hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.17,0:22:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why don't Thea's seduction attempts work on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her seduction is all based around first locking eyes\Nwith her target and peering into their heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.67,0:22:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, and she can't pull that off against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.17,0:22:23.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.96,0:22:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm not quite sure how I should handle her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.88,0:22:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her attempts have been getting kind of extreme,\Nand it's starting to become a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.63,0:22:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.96,0:22:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've brought you some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.33,0:22:48.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why you're wearing that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.92,0:22:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go on, Grete.\NNow's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Rabbits' mating season is said to last the entire year,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.38,0:23:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so my outfit symbolizes the way that I'm ready\Nand prepared to accept men at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.67,0:23:03.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel as though you've misunderstood my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:04.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.33,0:23:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm ready and prepared to accept you at any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.29,0:23:11.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry to butt in...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.25,0:23:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.67,0:23:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...but can I say something in Klaus's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:34.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure that's not your size.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.46,0:23:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,WHY?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.71,0:02:40.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,612)}{\an7}FILE: Dreamspeaker Thea
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.96,0:09:44.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(179.2,547.2)}{\an7}FILE: Dreamspeaker Thea
